    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/e2f546e49ab1baad6eceb1bba0303316.avif?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/89c797a5f45ca137c604a7f0e66e0d3c.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Scout</strong> procedural lands that shift beneath your feet.<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Survive</strong> against the fierce barbarian horde.<br>\ud83c\udf86 <strong>Discover</strong> deep systems and powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/a8d8f0607bbba76f1a6cd68a57f84ec9.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Mix</strong> over 200 game-changing technologies.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Improvise</strong> to make the most of each unique run.<br>\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Watch</strong> your choices snowball, creating wildly different civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/9932904974fbfeaf0a6fd7df699cd2e6.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Draft</strong> your perfect deck of cards to craft a unique strategy.<br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Upgrade</strong> your cards, units and cities in every era.<br>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Build</strong> an enduring empire, from the stone age to the singularity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/3f3eed05c641fdc90f44675e569a8e18.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achieve</strong> tough challenges to reveal new content.<br>\u2728 <strong>Unlock</strong>\u00a0permanent upgrades between matches.<br>\u26b0\ufe0f <strong>Die</strong> in spectacular fashion, and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/e2f546e49ab1baad6eceb1bba0303316.avif?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/89c797a5f45ca137c604a7f0e66e0d3c.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Scout</strong> procedural lands that shift beneath your feet.<br>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f <strong>Survive</strong> against the fierce barbarian horde.<br>\ud83c\udf86 <strong>Discover</strong> deep systems and powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/a8d8f0607bbba76f1a6cd68a57f84ec9.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Mix</strong> over 200 game-changing technologies.<br>\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Improvise</strong> to make the most of each unique run.<br>\u2744\ufe0f <strong>Watch</strong> your choices snowball, creating wildly different civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/9932904974fbfeaf0a6fd7df699cd2e6.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Draft</strong> your perfect deck of cards to craft a unique strategy.<br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Upgrade</strong> your cards, units and cities in every era.<br>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Build</strong> an enduring empire, from the stone age to the singularity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275940/extras/3f3eed05c641fdc90f44675e569a8e18.webp?t=1754755834\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Achieve</strong> tough challenges to reveal new content.<br>\u2728 <strong>Unlock</strong>\u00a0permanent upgrades between matches.<br>\u26b0\ufe0f <strong>Die</strong> in spectacular fashion, and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
